WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.840
Separate reusable services
from domain-specific knowledge.

00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:06.720
A shared platform can supply datasets,

00:00:06.778 --> 00:00:10.480
evaluation runners, identity,
evidence and recovery tooling.

00:00:10.580 --> 00:00:14.800
Payment teams still define transaction
invariants and recovery cases.

00:00:14.893 --> 00:00:18.160
Other domains own their own
behavior and acceptance rules.

00:00:18.293 --> 00:00:21.200
Model and tool adapters
should remain replaceable.

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:25.280
The diagram shows responsibilities,
not a budget allocation.

00:00:25.456 --> 00:00:28.480
Fund both the shared
service and the expertise

00:00:28.542 --> 00:00:30.560
required to make its output meaningful.
